Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:05.62,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}20{\fs68}号 里昂站首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.62,0:00:08.42,TL,,0,0,0,,法国人穆泰对阵同胞安贝尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:11.58,TL,,0,0,0,,打到决胜盘 穆泰{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.44,0:00:15.61,TL,,0,0,0,,打完这一分 他突然倒在了地上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:19.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, well, is he cramping?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦 他是抽筋了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.69,0:00:21.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think that might be the situation.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看来是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:28.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, he has been away from action like we said for nearly two months.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他已经快两个月没比赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:30.91,TL,,0,0,0,,他被扶了起来 比赛接着打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.91,0:00:34.17,TL,,0,0,0,,可主裁还是判他超时 给了一次警告
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:37.44,TL,,0,0,0,,按规则 抽筋不能叫医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.94,0:00:39.69,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘打进抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.69,0:00:41.64,TL,,0,0,0,,他先{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:47.08,TL,,0,0,0,,接下来九分 他拿了七分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:49.04,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}赢下抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:52.50,TL,,0,0,0,,可抽筋倒地 为什么还会被警告？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:56.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it's glorious.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:12.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a fighter he is.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真是个斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:13.87,TL,,0,0,0,,先看规则
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.87,0:01:16.34,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}ATP{\fs68}和大满贯的规则都写着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.34,0:01:19.16,TL,,0,0,0,,抽筋 不能叫医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.49,0:01:21.59,TL,,0,0,0,,只能在换边的{\fs78}90{\fs68}秒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.59,0:01:24.68,TL,,0,0,0,,或者盘间的{\fs78}120{\fs68}秒里治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.01,0:01:28.37,TL,,0,0,0,,一场比赛 抽筋最多治疗两次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.66,0:01:31.76,TL,,0,0,0,,分与分之间 只有{\fs78}25{\fs68}秒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:34.56,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次超时 是警告 再犯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.36,TL,,0,0,0,,发球方判一次发球失误
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.36,0:01:38.62,TL,,0,0,0,,接发方直接丢一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.96,0:01:39.87,TL,,0,0,0,,真撑不住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:42.35,TL,,0,0,0,,可以先放弃几分 甚至几局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.35,0:01:44.41,TL,,0,0,0,,拖到换边再治
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.57,0:01:47.52,TL,,0,0,0,,这条规则 不少球员都碰上过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:49.02,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2021{\fs68}年迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:51.36,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫对波皮林
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.26,0:02:01.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You have to say, well played, Daniil Medvedev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N打得好 梅德韦杰夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:09.14,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Digging so deep, clearly really struggling with cramp.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N咬牙撑住 明显被抽筋折磨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:15.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But he's somehow found a way to win that match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但他还是赢下了这场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:20.94,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年阿卡普尔科
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.94,0:02:23.42,TL,,0,0,0,,科兹洛夫对季米特洛夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:26.46,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘 他打着打着就抽筋了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.37,0:02:29.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He gets the break!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他破发了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.77,0:02:31.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And he's cramping!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可他抽筋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:37.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh my goodness. Unbelievable.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N天哪 难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:43.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No, I think he has to forfeit this game to get to the change of ends.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他得放弃这一局 才能拖到换边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:46.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, Dimitrov helping him out here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N季米特洛夫在帮他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:49.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, isn't that great sportsmanship from Dimitrov?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N季米特洛夫真有体育精神
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:53.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He came straight over, he showed concern immediately.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他马上就过来 第一时间表示关心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.57,0:02:55.22,TL,,0,0,0,,最后科兹洛夫赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.22,0:02:57.77,TL,,0,0,0,,打了{\fs78}3{\fs68}小时{\fs78}21{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:03.25,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年上海 天气又湿又热
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:04.98,TL,,0,0,0,,辛纳右腿抽筋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:07.74,TL,,0,0,0,,第三盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}落后 他选择退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:10.02,TL,,0,0,0,,和格里克斯普尔握手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:12.39,TL,,0,0,0,,今年澳网半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:14.46,TL,,0,0,0,,阿尔卡拉斯对兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:17.35,TL,,0,0,0,,第三盘 阿尔卡拉斯的腿出了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.35,0:03:19.59,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到一次医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.67,0:03:23.34,TL,,0,0,0,,医疗暂停之后 他接着打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:24.86,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫很不满
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:27.63,TL,,0,0,0,,认为抽筋不该给医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:32.61,TL,,0,0,0,,阿尔卡拉斯说 他以为是受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:34.18,TL,,0,0,0,,最后他{\fs78}5{\fs68}盘获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:36.74,TL,,0,0,0,,打了{\fs78}5{\fs68}小时{\fs78}27{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:39.82,TL,,0,0,0,,规则写得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:42.91,TL,,0,0,0,,可抽筋到倒地 该不该多给几秒？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:44.69,TL,,0,0,0,,评论区说说
